# FF TRUST — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real secrets.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL
#   Canonical production site URL used for Open Graph images, canonical links,
#   sitemap.xml, robots.txt and structured data (Organization logo).
#   Set this in Netlify: Site settings -> Environment variables.
#   Leave UNSET for local development (http://localhost:1111 is used).
#   NEVER set this to localhost for production metadata.
#
# Example (the real deployed domain is configured separately on Netlify):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:1111
